<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Baroda To Bhandup Packers And Movers
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required to book transporters for Baroda to Bhandup Mumbai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">To hire a certified mover for the Baroda‑Bhandup corridor, you’ll need a valid government‑issued ID, GST registration certificate (if applicable), proof of ownership for the items, and a signed service agreement. Additionally, an e‑Way bill is mandatory for interstate freight, and the mover’s IBA approval certificate should be verified.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the freight cost calculated for a household shift from Baroda to Bhandup?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Freight cost is based on total volume (in cubic feet), weight of goods, type of container truck selected, distance covered, fuel surcharge, and any special handling requirements. Shree Ashirwad provides a transparent cost matrix that itemises packing, loading, insurance, and GST on shifting of household goods, ensuring no hidden fees.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is my goods insurance valid for the entire 1,500‑km journey on NH 19?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. The 100% insured service includes IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance that covers the full 1,499 km route from Baroda to Bhandup. The policy protects against loss, theft, and damage from road incidents, and claims can be filed directly through the mover’s dedicated insurance liaison.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my shipment in real time during the Baroda‑Bhandup transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">All Shree Ashirwad container trucks are equipped with satellite GPS devices that feed live location data to a customer portal. You can monitor the exact position, estimated arrival time, and any check‑post clearances, giving you full visibility throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures are taken for moving delicate items like glassware or temple idols?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Delicate items are secured using the 7‑layer protective packaging system, which includes high‑density bubble cushioning, multi‑ply corrugated sheets, foam edge protectors, and custom wooden crates. Each piece is also strapped with high‑tensile ratchet lashings and placed on hydraulic ramps to prevent jarring during loading and unloading.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any special permits needed for transporting vehicles on this route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Vehicle transport requires a valid transport permit and compliance with the National Highways Authority regulations. Shree Ashirwad’s dedicated two‑wheeler carriers come with wheel chocks and ratchet lashings, and the company handles all necessary permits, ensuring smooth passage through each state’s checkposts.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the IBA approval benefit me as a customer?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">IBA approval guarantees that the mover adheres to industry‑wide standards for safety, documentation, and dispute resolution. It also means the company follows a code of conduct that protects your interests, provides a clear grievance redressal mechanism, and often results in faster claim settlements for insured moves.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
